            "value": [
              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>The dataset consists of all data collected for a research on displacement and resettlement of informal settlements households in Kigali, the capital of Rwanda (doi.org.10.3990/1.9789036554596). The research focuses on the resettlement projects, either induced by disaster risks or development projects such us settlement redevelopment projects in the context of implementing the Master Plan.<br>The entire research had four specific objectives:<br>1. To analyse the impacts of both the urban (re)development and disaster risks induced displacement and resettlement processes on the livelihood of affected informal settlement dwellers.<br>The dataset for this first study is already published by DANS Easy with this doi: 10.17026/dans-zvv-xtb6<br>2. To examine the governance practices in the resettlement of informal settlement dwellers and how it influences participation and local affected people’s responses<br>The dataset for this second study is already published by DANS Easy with this doi: 10.17026/dans-xae-2xdw<br>3. To analyse and integrate key stakeholders’ preferences in evaluating the suitability of potential resettlement locations<br>4. To develop and test a planning support tool that could support collaborative resettlement site identification<br>The dataset for the third and fourth objectives is published by DANS Easy with this doi:10.17026/dans-xx3-xjfn</p>"
                }
              }
            ]
